give @s written_book{title:"Culling",author:"lollip0529",pages:['"Culling\\n\\nWhy the portal room\'s spawner doesn\'t spike in the pie from where you start.\\n\\nThe game only draws what it finds by looking through open air, one 16x16x16 block cube at a time."','"Too far (64+)\\n\\nThe spawner doesn\'t render because it\'s more than 64 blocks away, and spawners only show in the pie within 64 blocks of you.\\n\\nFix: Get within 64 blocks of it."','"Directionality\\n\\nA closer cube is reached from the wrong side first, and because the game only checks each cube once, it never tries the side the way to the spawner needs.\\n\\nFix: No sure fix. Move, or look up or down to hide the wrong way."','"Vertical culling\\n\\nThe way to the spawner goes down and back up, or up and back down, and because the game never looks back the way it came, it never finds it.\\n\\nFix: Change your Y level past a multiple of 16 (like Y 32)."','"Horizontal culling\\n\\nThe way to the spawner doubles back sideways, and because the game never looks back the way it came, it never finds it.\\n\\nFix: Walk into the next chunk over."','"Lack of air\\n\\nThe air between you and the portal room doesn\'t link from cube to cube, and because the game only moves between cubes through air, it never finds the spawner.\\n\\nFix: Try another spot, or dig toward the portal room."','"Flush hidden\\n\\nSolid blocks close off the way into the portal room, and because the game only looks through open air, it can\'t see past them.\\n\\nFix: Check the 5-way for hiddens that are flush with chunk borders."','"Chunk border\\n\\nThe spawner is hidden from the cube you stand in, because the game starts looking from that cube and from there it never reaches the spawner.\\n\\nFix: Walk into the next chunk on the same level. Often that\'s only a step or two away."','"Angle\\n\\nNo way to the spawner fits on your screen, because the game only looks at what\'s on screen and a tall, thin view shows too narrow a slice.\\n\\nFix: EyeZoom: check on Thin.\\nThin: try 30 FOV."','"Ghost spike\\n\\nIt spikes only while you face away from the portal room, because the game counts the spawner\'s whole cube if any corner is on screen, and Thin and EyeZoom see far up and down. Hiding off-screen cubes can also open another way in."','"Fix: Confirm it from a second spot before sending."']}
